        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.26945v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-04-29T17:54:52Z",
        "description": "We introduce a quantum algorithm for simulating the dynamics of electrical circuits consisting of resistors, inductors and capacitors (aka RLC circuits) along with power sources. Given oracle access to the connectivity of the circuit and values of the electrical elements, our algorithm prepares a qu",
