        "description": "Identifying the physical mechanism driving blazar flares remains a central challenge in high-energy astrophysics. We show that the energy dependence of the standard deviation of the polarization angle variability ($σ_\\text{PA}$) provides a powerful and robust discriminator of blazar flaring mechanis",
