        "pubDate": "2026-04-29T17:39:38Z",
        "description": "NASA's Habitable Worlds Observatory (HWO) will search for biosignatures on Earth-like exoplanets using reflected light spectroscopy. A critical instrument design parameter is resolving power, which must balance biosignature detectability against exposure time and detector noise constraints. We asses",
